- Supports glob patterns like "**/*.js" or "src/**/*.ts"
- Returns matching file paths sorted by modification time
- Use this tool when you need to find files by name patterns`,gl=`${ir}
- When you are doing an open ended search that may require multiple rounds of globbing and grepping, use the ${gt} tool instead (if available)`;function Fqo(e,n,s){if(RM({model:e,leanPrompt:n})){if(VG({model:e,leanRewrite:s}))return tr;return`Content search built on ripgrep. Prefer this over \`grep\`/\`rg\` via ${Be} \u2014 results integrate with the permission UI and file links.

